---
import Site from '../../layouts/Site.astro';
---

<Site
	title="Plate — Website Redesign · Steven Vanden Heuvel"
	description="Building the go-to digital platform for chefs and foodservice professionals. 2017 Jesse H. Neal Award for Best Website."
>
	<section class="cs-hero">
		<div class="cs-hero__inner">
			<a class="cs-back-top" href="/#work">← Case studies</a>
			<p class="eyebrow">Case study</p>
			<h1 class="cs-hero__title display">Plate Website<br />Redesign</h1>
			<p class="cs-hero__lede">Building the go-to digital platform for chefs and foodservice professionals.</p>
			<dl class="cs-meta">
				<div><dt>Role</dt><dd>Creative Director</dd></div>
				<div><dt>Org</dt><dd>MTG Media Group</dd></div>
				<div><dt>Recognition</dt><dd>Jesse H. Neal Award, Best Website</dd></div>
			</dl>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section--alt">
		<div class="section__inner">
			<div class="cs-figure" data-animate="fade">
				<img src="/images/case-studies/plate/plate-hero.jpg" alt="Plate magazine covers and editorial spreads" />
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">Problem</p>
				<p class="cs-block__lede">A digital experience that matched the print quality.</p>
				<p>Plate needed a digital experience that matched the quality of its print publication. The existing site did not serve the needs of chefs and foodservice professionals looking for editorial content, recipes, and industry news in one place.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section--alt">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">Solution</p>
				<p class="cs-block__lede">Typography, color, and photography in service of editorial.</p>
				<p>I combined clear typography, vibrant color palettes, and engaging photography to showcase Plate's editorial content. Working closely with editors, developers, and contributors, the redesigned site brought Plate's culinary storytelling to life online.</p>
			</div>
			<ul class="cs-pillars">
				<li>
					<h3 class="cs-pillar__title">Typography-led design</h3>
					<p>Clear hierarchy supporting editorial depth and chef profiles.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<h3 class="cs-pillar__title">Content-first architecture</h3>
					<p>Intuitive navigation connecting recipes, interviews, and industry news.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<h3 class="cs-pillar__title">Authenticated audience</h3>
					<p>Built for foodservice buyers, operators, and chefs.</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section">
		<div class="section__inner cs-body" data-animate="fade">
			<div class="cs-block">
				<p class="eyebrow">Results</p>
				<h2 class="cs-h2 display">Recognized work, real outcomes.</h2>
			</div>
			<ul class="cs-awards">
				<li><span class="cs-awards__mark">★</span><span>Jesse H. Neal Award — Best Website</span></li>
				<li><span class="cs-awards__mark">★</span><span>Folio OZZIE Honorable Mention — Site Design</span></li>
			</ul>
			<blockquote class="cs-quote">
				"What made it successful was not just the design. It was understanding how restaurant professionals actually worked and building something that made their jobs easier."
			</blockquote>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="section section--alt">
		<div class="section__inner cs-back">
			<a class="btn" href="/work/paypal">← PayPal</a>
			<a class="btn btn--primary" href="/work/blackbird">Next: Project Blackbird →</a>
		</div>
	</section>
</Site>

<style>
	.cs-hero { max-width: var(--max); margin: 0 auto; padding: var(--space-2xl) var(--gutter); }
	.cs-back-top { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: var(--space-lg); color: var(--text-mute); font-size: var(--text-body-sm); }
	.cs-back-top:hover { color: var(--lime); }
	.cs-hero__title { margin: var(--space-xs) 0 var(--space-lg); max-width: 16ch; }
	.cs-hero__lede { font-size: var(--text-deck); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.5; max-width: 56ch; margin-bottom: var(--space-2xl); font-weight: 500; }
	.cs-meta { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: var(--space-md); margin: 0; padding: var(--space-lg) 0 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
	.cs-meta div { margin: 0; }
	.cs-meta dt { font-size: var(--text-label); letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-mute); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: var(--space-xs); }
	.cs-meta dd { margin: 0; color: var(--text); font-size: var(--text-body); font-weight: 500; }

	.cs-figure { max-width: 75%; margin: 0 auto; }
	.cs-figure img { width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; }

	.cs-body { display: grid; gap: var(--space-2xl); max-width: var(--max-narrow); }
	.cs-block .eyebrow { margin-bottom: var(--space-sm); }
	.cs-block__lede { color: var(--text); font-size: 28px; font-weight: 500; margin: 0 0 var(--space-md); letter-spacing: -0.015em; line-height: 1.2; }
	.cs-block p { color: var(--text); margin: 0; font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.6; }
	.cs-h2 { max-width: 18ch; margin: 0; }

	.cs-pillars { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: var(--space-md); }
	.cs-pillars li { padding: var(--space-md) 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); }
	.cs-pillar__title { margin: 0 0 var(--space-sm); }
	.cs-pillars li p { color: var(--text); font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.55; }

	.cs-awards { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 0; }
	.cs-awards li { display: flex; gap: var(--space-md); align-items: center; padding: var(--space-md) 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); font-size: 18px; }
	.cs-awards li:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--rule); }
	.cs-awards__mark { color: var(--lime); font-size: 22px; min-width: 24px; }

	.cs-quote { margin: var(--space-lg) 0 0; padding: 0 0 0 var(--space-lg); border-left: 2px solid var(--lime); font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 400; font-style: normal; font-variation-settings: "wght" 400, "slnt" 0, "ital" 0; font-synthesis: none; font-size: clamp(20px, 2vw, 28px); line-height: 1.4; color: var(--text); max-width: 64ch; }

	.cs-back { display: flex; gap: var(--space-sm); flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }

	@media (max-width: 700px) {
		.cs-meta { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
		.cs-pillars { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
		.cs-figure { max-width: 100%; }
	}
</style>
